WEBVTT

00:01.464 --> 00:03.764
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.904 --> 00:06.924
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.434 --> 00:10.174
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.174 --> 00:14.804
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.244 --> 00:22.204
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.954 --> 00:26.824
Dragon Drive

00:26.824 --> 00:32.314
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.464 --> 00:35.434
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.434 --> 00:38.664
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.164 --> 00:43.544
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.544 --> 00:45.504
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.504 --> 00:51.814
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.554 --> 00:55.914
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.914 --> 00:59.114
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.454 --> 01:04.464
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.464 --> 01:06.014
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.164 --> 01:08.564
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.564 --> 01:11.694
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.104 --> 01:17.174
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.174 --> 01:19.904
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.904 --> 01:27.574
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:39.964 --> 01:42.024
I'm burning up!

01:42.234 --> 01:43.064
Chibi!

01:43.134 --> 01:46.334
I'm not letting you die, either!

01:47.334 --> 01:48.994
What's wrong, Thundervolt?!

01:49.604 --> 01:50.574
Why won't you move?!

01:51.404 --> 01:52.534
Stop right there!

01:53.714 --> 01:57.544
Kouhei! I'll be your opponent!

02:06.184 --> 02:09.484
The Mysterious Warrior

02:17.204 --> 02:18.164
Here I go, Reiji!

02:18.904 --> 02:20.894
You can give it everything, Ichirou!

02:21.334 --> 02:23.634
Really? You've become quite confident.

02:23.704 --> 02:26.644
Then I'll do exactly as you say!

02:35.214 --> 02:38.084
No, really, give it everything
you've got, Ichirou!

02:38.154 --> 02:39.784
You don't have to hold back!

02:40.224 --> 02:41.244
Shippuzan!

02:46.834 --> 02:48.994
Is that all you're capable of?

02:49.264 --> 02:50.754
Wh-What do you mean "is that all"?

02:52.734 --> 02:54.564
It's my turn now!

02:54.834 --> 02:56.394
Chibi! We'll use SinnSaber!

03:12.284 --> 03:15.554
Hey, we're allies! Save your energy!

03:15.694 --> 03:18.284
But I was actually holding back my power.

03:18.494 --> 03:21.054
What's the big deal?
I missed you anyway!

03:21.334 --> 03:23.854
"Missed me anyway"?

03:24.964 --> 03:26.694
That's enough for now.

03:26.934 --> 03:28.464
I'm going off to get some rest.

03:28.604 --> 03:29.594
What?!

03:29.674 --> 03:31.834
H-H-Hey, you're calling it quits already?

03:32.044 --> 03:34.234
I promise to hold back even more...

03:34.314 --> 03:36.604
...so let's continue for a little longer!

03:37.084 --> 03:38.344
Just a bit more!

03:38.414 --> 03:42.214
I just need a little more practice
to get the hang of it!

03:42.284 --> 03:44.154
Please!

03:44.224 --> 03:45.614
Give me a break.

03:45.924 --> 03:48.824
You think I want to risk getting hurt
from the ultimate attack of an ally?

03:49.094 --> 03:51.024
Man, you're stingy.

03:51.364 --> 03:52.454
Oh, well.

03:52.524 --> 03:56.324
I'm getting pretty comfortable
at controlling SinnSaber's power...

03:56.394 --> 03:58.994
No one can beat me now!

03:59.664 --> 04:03.404
You know, I might just be able
to beat Kouhei without anyone's help!

04:04.274 --> 04:05.744
Kouhei!

04:05.844 --> 04:09.074
Next time we meet,
I'll be certain to put an end to you!

04:09.744 --> 04:11.974
You just wait and see!

04:15.614 --> 04:17.484
Ichirou, good going!

04:17.624 --> 04:20.114
That guy gets carried away too easily.

04:20.294 --> 04:22.854
- I wonder what's gotten into him.
- What a weirdo.

04:24.124 --> 04:28.324
Did you notice that
Reiji and Chibi have gotten much stronger?

04:28.664 --> 04:29.464
Yeah.

04:29.534 --> 04:32.964
We shouldn't have any problems
beating Kouhei this time!

04:33.304 --> 04:35.464
When you say "we",
don't you really mean "Reiji"?

04:36.374 --> 04:37.604
I'd be happy if that were the case.

04:37.674 --> 04:40.144
- Huh?
- What do you mean, Mr. Taiyou?

04:40.244 --> 04:42.174
Are we still too weak to beat Kouhei?

04:42.274 --> 04:43.674
Well, not necessarily...

04:43.914 --> 04:45.314
...but something doesn't feel right.

04:45.714 --> 04:48.444
Well, I kind of know the feeling,
Mr. Taiyou.

04:48.554 --> 04:51.574
You did lose to Kouhei once, after all.

04:52.184 --> 04:54.674
I know how frustrated you must feel.
I really do!

04:55.124 --> 04:57.214
No, that's not it.

04:58.424 --> 04:59.864
I'll check myself to see if I'm right.

05:01.894 --> 05:03.924
I wish I could practice at full power.

05:06.204 --> 05:09.224
Reiji. I'll be your next opponent!

05:09.604 --> 05:10.974
Mr. Taiyou!

05:11.044 --> 05:12.374
Can I go all out?

05:12.444 --> 05:14.034
Sure, but try to go easy on me!

05:14.274 --> 05:17.404
Okay! I'm gonna give it everything!

05:17.784 --> 05:18.744
Go, Chibi!

05:22.584 --> 05:24.554
Mr. Taiyou! Please fight me seriously!

05:25.424 --> 05:28.114
But I am fighting seriously!

05:32.394 --> 05:34.054
What's wrong, Chibi?!

05:34.464 --> 05:37.724
Mr. Taiyou, how can I practice
if you keep running away?!

05:37.904 --> 05:39.164
Sorry about that.

05:40.434 --> 05:42.924
They've become a lot stronger... but...

05:43.974 --> 05:45.444
Something's not right.

05:55.784 --> 05:56.614
Chibi!

05:56.684 --> 05:57.714
Chibi!

05:58.784 --> 06:00.754
Don't let Mr. Taiyou get away this time!

06:01.394 --> 06:02.554
One more time!

06:02.924 --> 06:05.054
Reiji, let's take a break!

06:05.164 --> 06:06.894
Not yet! I'm just getting warmed up!

06:07.194 --> 06:08.164
Here I go!

06:11.204 --> 06:13.254
I'm impressed that they don't get tired of it.

06:18.444 --> 06:19.664
Kyoji!

06:19.744 --> 06:21.764
Don't just stand there, help me!

06:22.374 --> 06:23.744
All right.

06:26.784 --> 06:28.944
What do you expect to learn
from checking these books?

06:29.114 --> 06:30.744
Have you forgotten?

06:31.454 --> 06:36.114
We must get the Dragonite back
from Kouhei Toki!

06:36.454 --> 06:38.124
The Dragonite?

06:38.724 --> 06:40.954
But the one he took with him...

06:41.034 --> 06:43.624
...can't revive Shinryu on its own, right?

06:44.164 --> 06:45.064
That's right.

06:45.734 --> 06:50.464
The Dragonite Kouhei Toki took
isn't what Shinryu is sealed in.

06:50.744 --> 06:53.304
Its purpose is to break the seal
of the Shrine that confines Shinryu.

06:53.504 --> 06:54.664
So our mission is...

06:54.744 --> 07:00.084
...to get the Dragonite before Kouhei
can use it to break Shinryu's seal!

07:00.144 --> 07:01.484
Have you forgotten?!

07:01.554 --> 07:03.074
I haven't forgotten.

07:03.214 --> 07:04.374
But can we find it?

07:04.454 --> 07:06.144
We will find it!!

07:06.324 --> 07:08.254
If only I could remember.

07:09.154 --> 07:11.884
If only I could remember the location
of the Shrine where Shinryu is sealed...

07:11.964 --> 07:14.694
...the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons.

07:15.064 --> 07:16.754
Then we could beat him there.

07:17.434 --> 07:19.094
The Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons?

07:19.704 --> 07:22.264
I'm sure I've been there before.

07:25.574 --> 07:28.444
Yes, I've been to the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons.

07:29.244 --> 07:31.504
But I can't remember its location...

07:31.644 --> 07:34.674
...or what happened while I was there.

07:35.114 --> 07:36.484
I can't remember.

07:36.614 --> 07:39.344
I wonder if you encountered
something quite frightening.

07:41.324 --> 07:43.514
Meguru doesn't remember.

07:43.724 --> 07:47.854
But all I really need to know
is where Kouhei Toki is headed.

07:48.134 --> 07:49.964
As long as I eventually get the Dragonite...

07:50.064 --> 07:52.724
...I may be able to return to Earth.

07:53.774 --> 07:55.264
Thundervolt.

07:55.804 --> 07:57.864
Why didn't you fight against that guy?

07:58.544 --> 08:01.704
Are you hiding something from me?

08:15.194 --> 08:18.184
If he wants to fight me, I accept.

08:18.694 --> 08:21.094
Let's go to him and fight!

08:24.934 --> 08:26.494
Well, easier said than done.

08:26.604 --> 08:28.394
Where will I find that guy?

08:28.504 --> 08:32.164
I guess there's no sense worrying about it.

08:32.574 --> 08:34.234
Chances are we'll find him eventually!

08:58.164 --> 09:00.634
Hmm... You're not bad.

09:03.574 --> 09:06.634
So, why have you been following me?

09:07.474 --> 09:10.374
You don't look like
one of Reiji Ohzora's group.

09:10.644 --> 09:12.114
Are you a surprise character in this game?

09:14.414 --> 09:17.354
What, aren't you here
because you wanna play with me?

09:17.424 --> 09:18.584
Or maybe...

09:18.954 --> 09:20.584
...you've got your eye on this.

09:21.954 --> 09:25.084
I have no interest in some stone.

09:25.664 --> 09:27.624
Then why would you be following me?

09:28.994 --> 09:32.364
I want to help you!

09:33.974 --> 09:34.934
Huh?

09:35.034 --> 09:36.974
You think I'm weak?

09:37.774 --> 09:39.604
Well, suit yourself.

09:39.974 --> 09:42.174
And what do you want for helping me?

09:42.714 --> 09:45.644
I simply want to be of some service to you.

09:46.014 --> 09:49.284
Seemingly you are being bothered
by those barbarous opponents.

09:49.354 --> 09:51.114
You want to team up with me?

09:51.554 --> 09:52.884
Yes.

09:57.824 --> 10:01.224
You just need to defeat
the pests surrounding Rockaku.

10:01.664 --> 10:04.364
And I'll take care of him.

10:06.564 --> 10:09.164
You've got a plan in mind, don't you?

10:09.374 --> 10:10.734
How scary!

10:12.074 --> 10:13.834
You won't regret accepting my offer.

10:14.774 --> 10:16.744
Sure, I'll let you team up with me.

10:17.544 --> 10:19.984
I said I'll let you team up with me!

10:20.684 --> 10:22.014
Thank you very much.

10:22.614 --> 10:23.944
Now that that's decided...

10:24.024 --> 10:25.514
...what do you wanna do next?

10:25.724 --> 10:28.344
Why don't we go and get rid
of those that are getting in your way?

10:28.424 --> 10:31.014
I know where to find them.

10:31.194 --> 10:34.284
You're suggesting that
we immediately attack the enemy base?

10:34.534 --> 10:38.264
I thought it would be easier for you
if we got rid of the pests first.

10:39.004 --> 10:39.864
All right.

10:40.134 --> 10:41.364
Then let's go.

10:41.704 --> 10:43.194
I'll show you the way.

11:11.164 --> 11:13.364
Wow! You're working hard!

11:13.434 --> 11:15.904
Have you found the location
of the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons?

11:16.004 --> 11:17.834
No. Not yet.

11:17.974 --> 11:18.944
What?!

11:19.044 --> 11:20.804
You still haven't found it?!

11:21.044 --> 11:22.274
Hurry up!

11:22.344 --> 11:25.644
If we take any longer,
Kouhei will revive Shinryu!

11:26.414 --> 11:27.404
I-I'm sorry.

11:27.514 --> 11:29.414
Hey Reiji! Will you cool it?!

11:29.554 --> 11:32.574
But Kouhei has already arrived in Rikyu!

11:32.784 --> 11:34.254
We don't have the luxury of sitting around!

11:34.324 --> 11:35.254
Hey!

11:36.124 --> 11:37.994
You're distracting us, so please leave.

11:38.624 --> 11:40.254
We're a little busy here.

11:40.794 --> 11:43.124
Damn, what's with that attitude?

11:43.364 --> 11:44.334
Reiji.

11:45.464 --> 11:46.734
You mustn't be impatient.

11:47.264 --> 11:48.664
What do you mean, Elder?

11:48.834 --> 11:50.734
I'm not being impatient.

11:51.244 --> 11:52.434
Are you sure?

11:53.144 --> 11:54.544
Right now, you look like...

11:54.614 --> 11:58.474
...someone who just can't wait
to go out and fight.

11:59.714 --> 12:02.344
That's not... true.

12:02.714 --> 12:04.274
I certainly hope you're right.

12:04.484 --> 12:05.474
Let's go!

12:18.034 --> 12:20.124
I'm going out to get some fresh air.

12:34.184 --> 12:35.154
It's no use.

12:35.684 --> 12:37.654
I just can't remember.

12:39.584 --> 12:41.054
What can I do to remember?

12:41.924 --> 12:43.724
You mustn't be so hard on yourself.

12:44.494 --> 12:46.184
You'll remember eventually.

12:46.264 --> 12:47.724
Ichirou.

12:48.464 --> 12:51.124
But in the meantime, RI-ON...

12:53.604 --> 12:54.934
We'll be okay.

12:55.004 --> 12:57.024
We've got Reiji on our side.

12:57.604 --> 13:00.094
I don't think we need to worry.

13:01.074 --> 13:02.044
Cheer up.

13:08.714 --> 13:12.414
Damn, Ichirou seems to be
doing so well with her!

13:12.484 --> 13:14.084
They look like lovers!

13:14.594 --> 13:16.424
Oh, why can't Maiko and I...

13:16.494 --> 13:17.424
Daisuke!

13:17.824 --> 13:19.194
Have you seen Rockaku?

13:19.394 --> 13:20.524
Rockaku?

13:20.894 --> 13:23.294
No, I haven't seen him!

13:23.664 --> 13:24.634
Really?

13:24.934 --> 13:26.694
Where could he have gone?

13:27.874 --> 13:29.464
Now could be my chance.

13:30.434 --> 13:32.034
M-Maiko.

13:32.304 --> 13:33.244
Yes?

13:33.304 --> 13:35.704
C-Can we talk for a moment?

13:36.214 --> 13:37.174
Okay.

13:37.484 --> 13:39.504
I wanted the chance... t-to talk...

13:39.814 --> 13:42.544
...you know... about our future.

13:43.554 --> 13:46.184
You know, one on one.

13:46.454 --> 13:47.544
Our future?

13:47.724 --> 13:51.054
You mean, about us getting the Dragonite
and returning to Earth?

13:51.494 --> 13:52.484
Y-Yeah!

13:53.194 --> 13:55.564
Well, n-no, not exactly.

13:55.764 --> 13:57.924
Well... you see...

13:58.004 --> 13:59.494
You're acting strange, Daisuke.

13:59.564 --> 14:00.894
Look here.

14:01.174 --> 14:03.074
You two seem to be hitting it off well.

14:03.334 --> 14:04.304
What?

14:04.844 --> 14:06.604
D-Don't be silly!

14:06.674 --> 14:08.164
It's not like that at all!

14:08.274 --> 14:11.374
I don't go around hitting on girls
like I see you doing!

14:12.484 --> 14:14.444
I already told you, you're misunderstanding!

14:14.654 --> 14:16.044
Stop lying!

14:16.114 --> 14:17.674
I'm not lying!

14:17.754 --> 14:19.684
- But you were being lovey-dovey with her!
- No, I wasn't! You were the one who was...

14:19.754 --> 14:22.584
- I wonder where Rockaku went.
...looking comfortable with Maiko!

14:32.464 --> 14:33.434
Who is it?!

14:39.474 --> 14:41.104
Who is that guy?

14:41.444 --> 14:42.534
Where is Rockaku?

14:42.814 --> 14:44.274
What do you want with him?!

14:46.884 --> 14:49.404
Answer my question. Otherwise...

14:50.754 --> 14:51.774
Kanper!

14:59.594 --> 15:01.624
I won't let you get one finger on Maiko!

15:02.334 --> 15:04.124
What is this, another fight?

15:04.504 --> 15:06.554
The people here must really be hated.

15:07.204 --> 15:08.794
I guess Rockaku isn't here.

15:09.304 --> 15:12.204
But in the meantime, it doesn't look
like he's gonna give me a hand.

15:15.774 --> 15:17.474
Let me see how well you fight.

15:17.884 --> 15:19.604
I can't allow you to be part of my team...

15:19.684 --> 15:21.584
...unless you can fight at a certain level.

15:21.954 --> 15:25.544
In that case, sit back and enjoy the show.

15:26.854 --> 15:27.824
Kanper!

15:35.364 --> 15:36.994
Don't forget about me!

15:40.004 --> 15:41.994
Damn! This guy is strong.

15:42.974 --> 15:44.664
Stop right there!

15:45.244 --> 15:46.204
Hey!

15:46.304 --> 15:49.474
I've got no idea who you are,
but I'll be your opponent!

15:49.714 --> 15:50.404
Okay!

15:50.474 --> 15:52.204
Wait a minute, Mr. Taiyou!

15:52.284 --> 15:53.144
Huh?

15:53.214 --> 15:55.084
Leave this to me!

15:55.214 --> 15:56.414
B-But...

15:56.484 --> 15:58.514
I can take care of this guy by myself.

15:59.224 --> 16:00.184
Let's go, Chibi!

16:06.724 --> 16:08.024
We're counting on you, Reiji!

16:08.094 --> 16:09.184
Leave it to me!

16:11.104 --> 16:12.394
Chibi! Let's do it!

16:13.204 --> 16:15.534
SinnSaber!

16:36.454 --> 16:38.054
Go!! Chibi!!

16:57.784 --> 16:59.644
There's no doubt this dragon is powerful.

17:01.214 --> 17:03.484
But all that power's useless
if he can't hit his target.

17:04.284 --> 17:05.714
One more time, Chibi!

17:10.254 --> 17:11.224
He disappeared!

17:12.964 --> 17:14.584
It's my turn now.

17:22.474 --> 17:23.594
I'm not done!

17:26.774 --> 17:27.744
Reiji!

17:30.174 --> 17:31.804
That attack was nothing!

17:34.584 --> 17:36.444
Chibi! What's wrong?

17:37.514 --> 17:39.414
Wh-What's going on?

17:47.564 --> 17:49.494
Chibi! Chibi!!

17:52.704 --> 17:53.964
Can't he move?

17:59.944 --> 18:01.344
Reiji! Are you all right?!

18:01.674 --> 18:02.664
Mr. Taiyou.

18:03.174 --> 18:03.834
Reiji!

18:10.684 --> 18:11.714
Ch-Chibi!

18:25.134 --> 18:26.364
Chibi!

18:27.874 --> 18:29.094
Chibi!!

18:34.774 --> 18:36.034
That should be about enough.

18:39.214 --> 18:41.274
He left without finishing us off.

18:41.384 --> 18:44.284
Who on Earth is that guy?

18:44.784 --> 18:46.514
It seems like we've avoided the worst.

18:46.754 --> 18:48.684
But things could be different next time.

18:49.194 --> 18:52.024
Especially with our ace in that condition.

18:56.394 --> 18:57.864
Is Chibi okay?

18:58.004 --> 18:59.694
I don't know.

19:06.604 --> 19:08.204
Wh-What did you say?!

19:09.674 --> 19:11.044
Are you serious?!

19:14.084 --> 19:16.214
No one told me any such thing!

19:16.984 --> 19:17.974
It's true.

19:18.624 --> 19:21.524
SinnSaber's powers are indeed immense.

19:22.154 --> 19:25.994
You could say Senkohcoola has
become the strongest of dragons.

19:26.924 --> 19:31.734
However, such powers come
from within Senkohcoola.

19:32.464 --> 19:36.164
The source of all that immense power
is Senkohcoola himself.

19:37.504 --> 19:40.134
His power is not limitless.

19:40.704 --> 19:45.164
Senkohcoola has been overworking himself
to try and please you, Reiji.

19:46.184 --> 19:48.584
But if he continues to overdo it...

19:49.054 --> 19:51.244
...what waits for him is certain death.

19:51.354 --> 19:52.254
Death?!

19:52.854 --> 19:54.984
Couldn't you hear it?

19:55.594 --> 19:57.784
Senkohcoola's cry for help?

20:06.834 --> 20:08.564
Sorry, Chibi.

20:08.634 --> 20:10.604
I misunderstood.

20:10.674 --> 20:15.074
I thought we had acquired
the strength to become invincible.

20:15.144 --> 20:16.274
I'm really sorry.

20:23.784 --> 20:25.484
What are they starting this time?

20:25.554 --> 20:29.494
They need more physical strength to reach
a higher level and control their powers.

20:29.994 --> 20:34.794
To avoid a repeat of what happened today,
they're toning their basic physical strength.

20:42.074 --> 20:44.634
Well, I must say, that certainly is like Reiji.

20:44.844 --> 20:45.824
You're right.

20:47.374 --> 20:48.774
You're pretty good.

20:48.874 --> 20:51.344
I now understand that you're capable
of fighting at a fairly high level.

20:51.744 --> 20:52.714
Then...

20:53.484 --> 20:54.844
You may join my team.

20:55.214 --> 20:56.844
My name's Kouhei Toki.

20:57.184 --> 20:59.154
- I'm...
- Just a moment!

21:00.254 --> 21:02.984
It looks like we have someone here
who likes to play hide and seek.

21:04.294 --> 21:05.924
You can come out now!

21:13.034 --> 21:14.834
Do not attack, Mr. Kouhei.

21:15.234 --> 21:17.224
I'm not your enemy.

21:18.274 --> 21:19.504
Then what are you?

21:19.604 --> 21:21.974
My name is Sayaka Towa.

21:22.714 --> 21:26.574
I would also like to join your team.

21:28.914 --> 21:31.904
This could be a lot of fun.

21:33.054 --> 21:35.614
Boy, Rikyu is a fun place.

21:56.044 --> 21:58.784
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.784 --> 22:01.554
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.554 --> 22:05.484
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.954 --> 22:09.724
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.724 --> 22:11.884
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.364 --> 22:16.454
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.894 --> 22:20.564
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.564 --> 22:23.304
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.304 --> 22:27.264
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.614 --> 22:31.114
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.114 --> 22:34.114
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.114 --> 22:38.984
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.654 --> 22:42.394
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.394 --> 22:45.164
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.164 --> 22:49.794
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.534 --> 22:53.304
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.304 --> 22:55.974
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.974 --> 23:00.604
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.274 --> 23:05.774
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.714 --> 23:12.384
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.624 --> 23:17.254
Next time

23:17.594 --> 23:18.614
This can't be true!

23:18.694 --> 23:21.784
Sayaka, what are you doing
together with Kouhei Toki?

23:22.434 --> 23:24.524
Does this mean she's a double agent?

23:24.804 --> 23:27.704
- Darn it! She can be so selfish!
- Bash! Pow! Boom!

23:27.764 --> 23:30.294
What? There's someone
who's even more selfish?!

23:30.604 --> 23:34.594
A scary lady who catches dragons left and
right, and makes sculptures out of them?!

23:34.674 --> 23:36.304
Who are you?!

23:37.014 --> 23:39.674
Next, on Dragon Drive,
"Shadow of a Friend".

23:40.014 --> 23:41.514
What? The identity of that man
in the sunglasses is...

23:41.514 --> 23:42.684
Shadow of a Friend
What? The identity of that man
in the sunglasses is...

23:42.684 --> 23:42.914
Shadow of a Friend

23:42.914 --> 23:44.084
Shadow of a Friend
Really?!

23:44.084 --> 23:44.344
Shadow of a Friend
